 Lisa, could you just explain a little bit further what that would do? But I''m quite happy to send a note to you with how that works, and if the committee would like, we can change that before the final budget is laid.', 'https://record.senedd.wales/Committee/16295', '2026-10-08', 'Peredur Owen Griffiths', '', '8579', '', '', 'Finance Committee', '3. Scrutiny of the Senedd Commission Draft Budget 2027-28: Evidence Session', '16295', 'http://www.senedd.tv/en/16295?startPos=133&l=en', NULL, 86.2, 'High', 'digest', 'fiscal_and_legislative_context; committee_scrutiny', 'Context; Housing system', '', 'Opportunity to influence', 'Finance Committee; draft budget; evidence session; final budget', 0, '2026-10-09T13:34:36.908938', 'https://record.senedd.wales/XMLExport/Download?meetingID=16295&xmlDownloadType=EnglishTranscript#777362', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);

 Is there anything that you''d like to add on that?', 'https://record.senedd.wales/Committee/16295', '2026-10-08', 'Peredur Owen Griffiths', '', '8579', '', '', 'Finance Committee', '3. Scrutiny of the Senedd Commission Draft Budget 2027-28: Evidence Session', '16295', 'http://www.senedd.tv/en/16295?startPos=4691&l=en', NULL, 86.2, 'High', 'digest', 'fiscal_and_legislative_context; committee_scrutiny', 'Context; Housing system', '', 'Opportunity to influence', 'Finance Committee; draft budget; evidence session', 0, '2026-10-09T13:34:37.633831', 'https://record.senedd.wales/XMLExport/Download?meetingID=16295&xmlDownloadType=EnglishTranscript#777408', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
